   318	
   319	She felt the plate come.
   320	
   321	It was not quick. It slid up over her calves on the moving stone as a lid slides onto a box, and settled, and the weight of the hill behind it leaned. Her left leg was in a hollow and it only pinned. Her right was lying across something hard.
   322	
